# FE golden matrix inputs. tools/fe-golden.mjs reads these from the workspace
# root; without them four of seven cases cannot even be generated and the gate
# fails for reasons unrelated to any code. They carry no secret - the only
# credential-shaped line is the runtime binding x-api-key: {{config.TMF_API_KEY}}.
!frontend-spec-*.yaml
